{"ancestors": "0,9023265,9023266", "bizKey": "9023268", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-07-18 16:02:26", "detail": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57);\"><strong>题材基本面介绍：</strong></span></p><p>磷酸二氢铵，又名磷酸一铵，是一种无机化合物，化学式为NH<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">4</span>H<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">2</span>PO<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">4</span>，为白色结晶性粉末，微溶于乙醇，不溶于丙酮，主要用作木材、织物、纸张的防火剂，也可用作化肥、面包改进剂、食品添加剂。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/18/c2ca029c-9298-4471-9953-c099ce8983b2-1689677636736.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 505.97px;height: 429.86px;\"/></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>", "firstLetter": "LSEA", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "磷酸二铵", "parentId": 9023266, "pctChg": -2.18, "reason": "高浓度磷肥包括磷酸二铵（DAP）、磷酸一铵（MAP）、NPK复合肥（P-NPK）、重钙（TSP）和硝酸磷肥（NP）", "remark": "", "sort": 1, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9023268, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-07-18 18:54:05"}
